  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Cross-site tracking for targeted advertising requires consent under GDPR Article 6(1)(a) and ePrivacy Directive Article 5(3). The European Data Protection Board has clarified that a compliant cookie consent mechanism providing clear information and obtaining affirmative opt-in consent is the appropriate lawful basis for behavioral tracking across websites.
Wrong (A): Legitimate interests alone generally cannot justify cross-site behavioral tracking due to its intrusive nature. The EDPB has ruled this processing disproportionate under a legitimate interest balancing test.
