Wrong (A): SOC 1 Type I is a restricted-use report addressing ICFR controls at a point in time. It cannot be publicly distributed or used as a website trust mark.
Wrong (B): SOC 1 Type II is also restricted-use and addresses ICFR over a period. It is not designed for public distribution.
